  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {盛|も}り{返|かえ}す (to rally, recover)\n- {勢|いきお}いを{盛|も}り{返|かえ}す (to regain momentum)\nUsed in sports (team comebacks), economics (recovery), health (recovering from illness), and business (company turnaround).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nCan be used both transitively and intransitively.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {持|も}ち{直|なお}す (to recover, rally - similar)\n- {挽回|ばんかい}する (to recover, make up for)\n- {復活|ふっかつ}する (to revive)",
